{
  "_about": "Hand-written cases for BillSplitEngine (Kotlin) and SwiftBillSplitEngine (iOS). Amounts are whole cents; surchargeBps is basis points (1000 = 10%). 'fixed' maps a person index to an amount they chose; everyone else shares the rest evenly, with leftover cents going to the earliest unfixed people. A case has either 'shares' (plus totalCents and surchargeCents) or 'error' (plus differenceCents).",
